(7738036, 1275811, 67145, '<td valign="top">ahh .. so this was yours .. <br/>what a great shot .. and GO YOU ..  with your committment ... !! .. :)<br/>i wish we had squirrels where i live . <br/>they would be wonderful to photograph .. they are so cute and photogenic .. <br/>and i believe much easier than the wildlife we have where i live . <br/>rabbits, kangaroos, wallabies, wombats .. none of them let you anywhere near them .. <br/>and then we have recently had an influx of feral pigs .. not only wouldnt let you anywhere near them but can be quite dangerous too . <br/>i used to be very pleased i lived here . rather than in america .. where if you go bush you could encounter a bear .. there''s nothing really dangerous around my home .. but now with the feral pigs .. things have changed .. :(</td>', 'ahh .. so this was yours .. what a great shot .. and GO YOU ..  with your committment ... !! .. :)i wish we had squirrels where i live . they would be wonderful to photograph .. they are so cute and photogenic .. and i believe much easier than the wildlife we have where i live . rabbits, kangaroos, wallabies, wombats .. none of them let you anywhere near them .. and then we have recently had an influx of feral pigs .. not only wouldnt let you anywhere near them but can be quite dangerous too . i used to be very pleased i lived here . rather than in america .. where if you go bush you could encounter a bear .. there''s nothing really dangerous around my home .. but now with the feral pigs .. things have changed .. :(', '2023-02-08 01:57:22.000000', NULL, 0),
